						<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
							<span style="font-size: 1rem;">📁</span>
							<label class="text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1e293b; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin: 0;">
