								<button type="button" id="btnBatchFuring" style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 10px; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; border: 1px solid #bae6fd; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;" title="Terapkan furing pada varian yang dicentang [✓]">Set Furing (Terpilih)</button>
							</div>
