								<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
									<span style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1e293b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">🛠️ Aksi Cepat / Set Serentak</span>
